---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about XYCHEN, its gaming coverage, community, and creator links."
>
  <section class="page-hero about-hero">
    <div class="container narrow-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">About XYCHEN</p>
      <h1>Games, discoveries, <span>and community.</span></h1>
      <p class="page-lead">XYCHEN brings gaming content and a community space together in one place.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-block about-content-section">
    <div class="container narrow-content prose about-copy">
      <h2>Gaming</h2>
      <p>The site currently focuses on Roblox, beginning with Grow a Garden. Coverage can include guides, useful details, discoveries, tips, and game updates.</p>
      <h2>Community</h2>
      <p>The Discord server is the community space connected to XYCHEN. Visit its page for the invitation and the official creator links.</p>
      <p><a href="/community/">Visit the community page</a></p>
      <h2>Reliable information</h2>
      <p>Published guides and updates should link to sources where relevant. Leaks and rumors must be clearly labelled as unconfirmed rather than presented as official information.</p>
      <h2>Creator links</h2>
      <p>Find the official social profiles and website repository on the <a href="/links/">Links page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
